  {
    "id": "retrieve_after_cartless_single_file_pick",
    "text": "After interacting with an item while cartless in a single-file shelf aisle, the customer must return to a cart before leaving, tying the duty to the functional parking-and-fetch pattern rather than to particular item coordinates.",
